		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Glue Shell</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A sticky firearm round that mires an area.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3. The area becomes Slowed Terrain for 1 minute or until dispersed. Creatures that start or end their turn in the area must make a STR save or be Restrained.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Targets that leave the area are still Slowed, 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on Grapple (STR) saves.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Posts the same STR save (fail: Restrained).</em></p><p><em>[M] Targets that leave the area are still Slowed for 2 turns.</em></p>",
